NOTE ON QUOTED MATERIAL

This work quotes and paraphrases element names, definitions and constraints
from the following documents, which remain the property of their publishers
and are reproduced here for identification and interoperability purposes:

  Software Bill of Materials for AI: Minimum Elements
  Published 2026 by BSI (Germany), ACN (Italy), ANSSI (France),
  CSE (Canada), CISA (United States), NCSC (United Kingdom) and
  NCO (Japan), in collaboration with the European Commission.

  2026 Minimum Elements for a Software Bill of Materials (SBOM), v2.1
  Published 2026 by CISA with 17 partner agencies.

Schema paths reference the CycloneDX specification (Apache 2.0, and ECMA-424)
and the SPDX specification (Linux Foundation).
